{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0001", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 5581, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "25743130", "baseline_text": "%t10", "kind": "ascr", "source": "%t10", "pointer_offset": 5224, "unit": "dialogue:a00cbea9173d423c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0002", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 5586, "capacity": 14, "raw_hex": "f0fa8143f944f366f261f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "자，가 볼까요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "さあ、やっちゃいますか！", "pointer_offset": 5228, "unit": "dialogue:ba8cf085c7ebf95f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0003", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 7864, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f8b2f0bcf0d7f0b9f147f15781432f2ff8dff64cf1442f2ff1acf25af8aaf64cf26bf0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "이 시합에서는，//제 패가//보너스 패예요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "この試合では、//わたしのパイが//ボーナスパイなんですよ∈", "pointer_offset": 5232, "unit": "dialogue:01b08bc6fb011f24", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0004", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 5668, "capacity": 56, "raw_hex": "f0b2fa48f1e2f0dff157f7d1f0b2f1c881b82f2ff8b2f140f0b9f1478143f15af8bdf9a9f1d5f0d2f0e72f2ff1e1fbc1f1e2f1d5f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "이번 주제는…이거∈//이 중에서，어느 한 세트를//맞춰 주세요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今回のお題は……これ！//この中の、どれか１組を//そろえちゃってくださいね∈", "pointer_offset": 5236, "unit": "dialogue:a5e2d10a50107a03", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0005", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 5743, "capacity": 30, "raw_hex": "f0b2f248f0b9f957f0dff1442f2ff5f3f0c7f8e7f362f0c8f0f1f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "이번에는 제가//딜러를 맡을게요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今度はわたしが//親をやっちゃいますね∈", "pointer_offset": 5240, "unit": "dialogue:ea77ee4713ef1189", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0006", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 7794, "capacity": 30, "raw_hex": "f0cff2c3f0f38143f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f944f5f3f0c7f26bf0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "다음은，오오가미 씨가 딜러예요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "次は、//大神さんが親ですよ！", "pointer_offset": 5244, "unit": "dialogue:6bda3ae2687494bc", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0007", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 5811, "capacity": 8, "raw_hex": "f473f999f1edf164", "baseline_text": "필살 공격", "kind": "ascr", "source": "必殺攻撃", "pointer_offset": 5248, "unit": "dialogue:a974a6ddab3c7143", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0008", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 5820, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f0b9f372f37281442f2ff0b9f0aef0ba8143f0e2f2d5f0aef26bf0ef81b82f2ff185f0b281b8", "baseline_text": "에헤헤．//에리카，대승리예요∈//브이∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "えへへ。//エリカ、大勝利ですっ∈//ブイッ！", "pointer_offset": 5252, "unit": "dialogue:e98fc57316832b3e", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0009", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 5863, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f0a5f1adf0a2f0a2f7d12f2ff9d0f26cf35df15af0eff7d12f2ff0b5f0b5f144f8abf2478143f25af16bf14bf0ef81608144", "baseline_text": "하우으으…//져 버렸어요…//오오가미 씨，너무해요～．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "はうぅぅ……//負けてしまいました……//大神さんのイジワル～。", "pointer_offset": 5256, "unit": "dialogue:7dd0dfa45dcd7564", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0010", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 5924, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f15af7d12f2ff3a1f0b1f957f28af144f0ef81482f2ff9a9fa48f2b88143f2d5f293f14bf0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "어…//끝나는 건가요？//한 번 더，승부해요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "えぇ……//終わっちゃうんですかぁ？//もう一回、勝負しましょうよ！", "pointer_offset": 5260, "unit": "dialogue:415145718b732c9b", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0011", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 5989, "capacity": 44, "raw_hex": "f0cffac3f0e2f9f7f26af0e2f1572f2ff0b0f8b1f247f149f0b8f0cf81b82f2ff0a4f8a4f0adf1d5f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "다음 대전 상대는//칸나 씨입니다∈//지지 마세요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "次の対戦相手は//カンナさんです！//負けないでくださいね！", "pointer_offset": 5264, "unit": "dialogue:47d85c2376cb1b28", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0012", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 6046, "capacity": 36, "raw_hex": "f0cff2c3f8f3f0a6f0a7f8a8f247f149f0b8f0cf81b82f2ff484f99cf1e2f1d5f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "다음은 사쿠라 씨입니다∈//힘내 주세요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "お次はさくらさんです！//がんばっちゃってくださいね！", "pointer_offset": 5268, "unit": "dialogue:2e9a4d15ad88b6c5", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0013", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 6099, "capacity": 14, "raw_hex": "f491f0a5f186f469f0b8f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "축하드립니다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "おめでとうございます。", "pointer_offset": 5272, "unit": "dialogue:b84710c5e1d20d4f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0014", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 6122, "capacity": 24, "raw_hex": "f0d8f2ca8143f253f293f8ddf0bcf0edf257f0f1f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "그럼，저부터 시작할게요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "それでは、わたしからですね！", "pointer_offset": 5276, "unit": "dialogue:da8efc31af73d591", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0015", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 6151, "capacity": 22, "raw_hex": "f0dcf0aef15a81432f2ff491f0a5f0d7f0b8f0cf81b8", "baseline_text": "클리어，//축하합니다∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "クリアー、//おめでとうございまーす！", "pointer_offset": 5280, "unit": "dialogue:61e636574c02b17a", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0016", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 6188, "capacity": 22, "raw_hex": "f18ef263f0b2f0a481432f2ff0e2f165f1a9f2e181b8", "baseline_text": "정말이지，//대단한걸∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "本当に、//たいしたもんだぜ！", "pointer_offset": 5284, "unit": "dialogue:5d2168b30926d97f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0017", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 6217, "capacity": 34, "raw_hex": "f2c3f7d12f2ff8d8f2d5fa93f348f19281432f2ff4eef4e6fa57f1d4f0a5f0a981b8", "baseline_text": "음…//그 승부 근성，//칭찬할 만하군∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "うむ……//その勝負強さ、//賞賛に値する！", "pointer_offset": 5288, "unit": "dialogue:c8b35ff61c6232e3", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0018", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 6258, "capacity": 36, "raw_hex": "f1c3f1c8f1c9f0a5f8dbf351f0a5f1be81432f2ff253f2c1f8f4f14ff695f0b8f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "즐거워하신 듯하여，//저희도 기쁩니다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "楽しんでいただけたようで、//私どもも喜んでいます。", "pointer_offset": 5292, "unit": "dialogue:bb8ecf0bcc56dfb3", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0019", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 6309, "capacity": 34, "raw_hex": "f253f0f481432f2ff1c3f1c8f3d2f15af0ef81442f2ff7d18169f0c5f0d8f0ac816a", "baseline_text": "저도，//즐거웠어요．//…（발그레）", "kind": "ascr", "source": "私も、//楽しませていただきました//……ぽっ。", "pointer_offset": 5296, "unit": "dialogue:d0ff52d5a95719b7", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0020", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 6354, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f0a5f0a4f1d481432f2ff151fbf8f1c3f1c8f25ef0f381432f2ff0b2f0dff293f0ddf0a8f16881b8", "baseline_text": "하지만，//진짜 즐거움은，//이제부터라구∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "でも、//本当のお楽しみは、//これからや！", "pointer_offset": 5300, "unit": "dialogue:9308ea26ea4f772a", "prior_review": "이슈 #7: 홍란 경상도 사투리"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0021", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 7905, "capacity": 44, "raw_hex": "f0b2f248f0b9f157f7d12f2ff0cff345f9a9f2b4f0c82f2ff3d6f0aff1acf957f8f1f1cff8c8f1c8f14881b8", "baseline_text": "이번에는…//다양한 역을//찾아보는 게 좋을 거야∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今度は……//いろんな役を//探してみるといいよ！", "pointer_offset": 5304, "unit": "dialogue:ce202bda37f8bf42", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0022", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 7950, "capacity": 32, "raw_hex": "f0aff3def0cff98cf2b4f0b2f0b1f7d12f2ff163f1b2f9a9fab4f16ff0f3f7d1", "baseline_text": "아름다운 역이나…//화려한 역 같은…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "美しい役や……//華麗な役など……", "pointer_offset": 5308, "unit": "dialogue:f6f9eb5154b499c0", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0023", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 7985, "capacity": 28, "raw_hex": "f2b4f8f3f0aff374f0f481432f2ff1b7f8b2f154f195f0b8f0cf81b8", "baseline_text": "역은 아직도，//많이 있답니다∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "役はまだまだ、//たくさんあるでーす！", "pointer_offset": 5312, "unit": "dialogue:8b1d388db686e151", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0024", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 6512, "capacity": 24, "raw_hex": "f0d8f28a81432f2ff1acf17df8b2f154f29ef157f2e18144", "baseline_text": "그건，//보람이 있겠는걸．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "そいつは、//やりがいがあるってもんだな。", "pointer_offset": 5316, "unit": "dialogue:c1aadaa3b2034b70", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0025", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 8014, "capacity": 18, "raw_hex": "f271fac0f2b4f0c82f2ff5c3f15ff1c7f7d1", "baseline_text": "모든 역을//갖추면…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "すべての役を、//揃えると……", "pointer_offset": 5320, "unit": "dialogue:02277706faf16b72", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0026", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 6582, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f2def944f1cff8f3f1ccf0b281432f2ff14ff0cff0aef984f154f0c8f0a4f8f4f3a7f0a88148", "baseline_text": "뭔가 좋은 일이，//기다리고 있을지도 몰라？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "何かいいことが、//待ってるかもしれないよ？", "pointer_offset": 5324, "unit": "dialogue:b6b93d0189b98cc3", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0027", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 6625, "capacity": 28, "raw_hex": "f0d8f2ca81432f2ff27bf15cf14bf947f1c3fac6f1e2f1d5f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "그럼，//계속해서 즐겨 주세요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "では、//続けてお楽しみください！", "pointer_offset": 5328, "unit": "dialogue:d088a9520ee26497", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0028", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 6658, "capacity": 28, "raw_hex": "f2b5f25af2a9f0d2f0e72f2ff0dcf0aef15af0ccf0a2f6aef0a3f7d1", "baseline_text": "토너먼트를//클리어했으므로…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "勝ち抜き戦を//クリアーしましたので……", "pointer_offset": 5332, "unit": "dialogue:d97b128891bdb165", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0029", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 6697, "capacity": 19, "raw_hex": "5f6a6f625f637572736f725f616e696d617465", "baseline_text": "_job_cursor_animate", "kind": "ascr", "source": "_job_cursor_animate", "pointer_offset": 5336, "unit": "dialogue:0dd10e8d7b60ab63", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0030", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 6717, "capacity": 19, "raw_hex": "40633130f0faf942f0e2f1f7406330f1d7f7d1", "baseline_text": "@c10자유 대전@c0와…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "@c10自由対戦@c0と……", "pointer_offset": 5340, "unit": "dialogue:ae22077f4280574d", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0031", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 6739, "capacity": 19, "raw_hex": "5f6a6f625f637572736f725f616e696d617465", "baseline_text": "_job_cursor_animate", "kind": "ascr", "source": "_job_cursor_animate", "pointer_offset": 5344, "unit": "dialogue:0dd10e8d7b60ab63", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0032", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 8033, "capacity": 41, "raw_hex": "40633130fe4cf3a5f364406330f0c82f2ff1d1f386fa57f94af154f8f1f243f1f3f0cef0b8f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "@c10패 편집@c0을//선택할 수 있게 되었습니다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "@c10パイ編集@c0が//選択できるようになりました。", "pointer_offset": 5348, "unit": "dialogue:4d4d80f851654eb4", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0033", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 6807, "capacity": 32, "raw_hex": "f0b2f3e3f0b22f2ff0faf942f0e2f9f7f1d1fb86f163f1c7f149f0b8f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "이곳이//자유 대전 선택 화면입니다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "こちらが、//自由対戦の選択画面です。", "pointer_offset": 5352, "unit": "dialogue:92265f3336bb2f18", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0034", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 6844, "capacity": 60, "raw_hex": "f0faf942f0e2f1f7f0b9f1472f2ff271f0f9f8e7f0b2f14ff984f0b1f1c781432f2ff1acf26af8b2f14ff0cff0aef984f154f0a2f0b8f261f0eff7d1", "baseline_text": "자유 대전에서//모두를 이기고 나면，//보상이 기다리고 있으니까요…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "自由対戦で//全員に勝ち抜くと、//ごほうびが待っていますので……", "pointer_offset": 5356, "unit": "dialogue:592596cfd90552ca", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0035", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 6907, "capacity": 30, "raw_hex": "f1f7f994f0dcf0aef15af8e7f182f1aaf0a32f2ff484f19cf1d5f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "전원 클리어를 목표로//힘내세요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "全員クリアーを目指して//がんばってくださいね。", "pointer_offset": 5360, "unit": "dialogue:7ea513e0b1291658", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0036", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 6954, "capacity": 24, "raw_hex": "f0dcf0aef15a81432f2ff491f0a5f186f469f0b8f0cf81b8", "baseline_text": "클리어，//축하드립니다∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "クリアー、//おめでとうございまーす！", "pointer_offset": 5364, "unit": "dialogue:61e636574c02b17a", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0037", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 6991, "capacity": 28, "raw_hex": "f0d8f2ca81432f2ff27bf15cf14bf947f1c3fac6f1e2f1d5f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "그럼，//계속해서 즐겨 주세요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "では、//続けてお楽しみください！", "pointer_offset": 5368, "unit": "dialogue:d088a9520ee26497", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0038", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 7024, "capacity": 36, "raw_hex": "f0b2f0dff293f0ddf7d12f2ff2b5f25af2a9f0d2f0e72f2ff0bcf0edf257f0f1f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "이제부터…//토너먼트를//시작할게요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "これから……//勝ち抜き戦を//はじめちゃいますね！", "pointer_offset": 5372, "unit": "dialogue:9bdfdb54356bc717", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0039", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 7073, "capacity": 22, "raw_hex": "f0e2f9f7f26af0e2f15781432f2ffb548254f2aaf7d1", "baseline_text": "대전 상대는，//총 ５명…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "対戦者は、//全部で５人……", "pointer_offset": 5376, "unit": "dialogue:86a99fe36c209047", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0040", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 7100, "capacity": 26, "raw_hex": "f0adf0a4f356f261f0a481432f2ff1c3fac6f1e2f1d5f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "마지막까지，//즐겨 주세요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "最後まで、//楽しんでくださいね！", "pointer_offset": 5380, "unit": "dialogue:42e4afe34f2a7ca5", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0041", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 7133, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f0b5f0b5f144f8abf24781432f2ff9a9f248f9d4f2b8f7d12f2ff283f8aff1e2f8a4f287f0a2f24df143f0ef8148", "baseline_text": "오오가미 씨，//한 번만 더…//놀아 주지 않으실래요？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "大神さん、//もう１回だけ……//遊んでくれませんか？", "pointer_offset": 5384, "unit": "dialogue:41bdd98998d4d4f7", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0042", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 7184, "capacity": 42, "raw_hex": "f0b9f0aef0ba8143f484fc95f1c8f26bf0ef81b82f2ffb49f1e2f8a4f287f8c8f1c8f0b8f261f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "에리카，힘낼 거예요∈//봐 주지 않을 거니까요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "エリカ、はりきっちゃいます！//容赦しませんからね∈", "pointer_offset": 5388, "unit": "dialogue:22248ee1232cda92", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0043", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 7235, "capacity": 58, "raw_hex": "f557f34e81b82f2ff0d88143f0d8f1d4f0f9f0bcf957f28af144f0ef81482f2ff0d8f27ef0cff1c7f7d1f0cff2c3f8b9fbf4f797f0f1f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "뜨악∈//그，그만두시는 건가요？//그렇다면…다음에 또 뵐게요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ガーン！//や、やめちゃうんですか？//なら……また今度ですね。", "pointer_offset": 5392, "unit": "dialogue:d9a2a8878fd6798f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0044", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 7296, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f0b9f372f37281442f2ff0b9f0aef0ba8143f0e2f2d5f0aef26bf0ef81b82f2ff185f0b281b8", "baseline_text": "에헤헤．//에리카，대승리예요∈//브이∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "えへへ。//エリカ、大勝利ですっ∈//ブイッ！", "pointer_offset": 5396, "unit": "dialogue:e98fc57316832b3e", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0045", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 7339, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f0a5f1adf1adf1adf7d12f2ff9d0f26cf35df15af0eff7d12f2ff0b5f0b5f144f8abf2478143f36cf1cdf1f8f0b281608144", "baseline_text": "하우우우…//져 버렸어요…//오오가미 씨，심술쟁이～．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "はうぅぅ……//負けてしまいました……//大神さんのイジワル～。", "pointer_offset": 5400, "unit": "dialogue:7dd0dfa45dcd7564", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0046", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 7400, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f15af7d12f2ff3a1f0b1f957f28af144f0ef81482f2ff9a9fa48f2b88143f2d5f293f14bf0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "어…//끝나는 건가요？//한 번 더，승부해요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "えぇ……//終わっちゃうんですかぁ？//もう一回、勝負しましょうよ！", "pointer_offset": 5404, "unit": "dialogue:415145718b732c9b", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN#0047", "file": "MINIGAME/JT08ERIC.SBN", "offset": 7465, "capacity": 19, "raw_hex": "5f6a6f625f637572736f725f616e696d617465", "baseline_text": "_job_cursor_animate", "kind": "ascr", "source": "_job_cursor_animate", "pointer_offset": 5408, "unit": "dialogue:0dd10e8d7b60ab63", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
